followcar_70.jpg","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/8VuNqAqkjS2YE66c8","source_page":"/meta/followCars"},{"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States","image":"geohints/followCars/followcar_29.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/followCars/followcar_29.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/fCTXAEUHwnstutEf6","source_page":"/meta/followCars"},{"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States","image":"geohints/followCars/followcar_30.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/followCars/followcar_30.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/PUApUGUBLd9AsS9v7","source_page":"/meta/followCars"},{"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States","image":"geohints/followCars/followcar_31.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/followCars/followcar_31.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/DJwEq1bajd1D4FSc8","source_page":"/meta/followCars"},{"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States","image":"geohints/followCars/followcar_32.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/followCars/followcar_32.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/pNr5pivcUjQDAUuP7","source_page":"/meta/followCars"},{"country":"united states of america","country_name":"United States","image":"geohints/followCars/followcar_33.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/followCars/followcar_33.jpg","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/itCXzgew2KggxSHQ6","source_page":"/meta/followCars"},{"country":"chile","country_name":"Chile","image":"geohints/followCars/followcar_79.webp","src":"https://ocsc00skc0wokcs8kw8g8k84.geohints.com/storage/followCars/followcar_79.jpg","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/rVqdLj2qiS27c5v68","source_page":"/meta/followCars"}],"tips":[{"id":"Kz7l","text":["The Cocos Islands runway can be recognized by it being the widest paved road on the island, with mowed grass on both sides of the runway and this [follow car](https://goo.gl/maps/evWNsAeXZ9ScSxqW9)."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/cocos-islands/Runway.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/meTENoyBJQZjYXiB8","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"cocos islands","country_name":"Cocos Islands"},{"id":"Rg9U","text":["A** yellow follow car** with two front windows can be seen trailing the Google truck on RN 2 east of Palmar Norte and halfway up to Buenos Aires. The **river valley** also makes this section of road unique."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/costa-rica/cr_followcar.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/f6V4TLHmAESKuk8Z8","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"costa rica","country_name":"Costa Rica"},{"id":"jBWo","text":["A significant portion of the coverage in the West Bank has a visible security **follow car**. The most extensive of these is a small **white Suzuki**, which is found in the central and southern regions."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/israel-west-bank/ps_followcarwhite.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/bdpqi69cm1efcunK8","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"israel and the west bank","country_name":"Israel & the West Bank"},{"id":"z5QI","text":["Another follow car is a small **dark blue Ford**, which is found in the northwest."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/israel-west-bank/ps_followcardarkblue.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/a38qLgKhQomdi26x5","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"israel and the west bank","country_name":"Israel & the West Bank"},{"id":"vqbJ","text":["This **larger white** Citroën follow car with a **West Bank licence plate** can be found in a region surrounding Jerusalem. It is noticeably found in the cities of Bethlehem and Ramallah.","NOTE: The [side](https://goo.gl/maps/CyZBjDakijcXH87L6) of this car features the text “SECURITY” in a bold font. Furthermore, this coverage will always feature a black Street View car with [no antenna](https://goo.gl/maps/qSquP511uzs7bk9o6)."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/israel-west-bank/ps_followcarbigwhite.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/FkHz1cDrgoL7ZUhn8","clues":["license_plates","follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"israel and the west bank","country_name":"Israel & the West Bank"},{"id":"fagW","text":["This **grey Hyundai** follow car is unique to Rahat."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/israel-west-bank/il_rahatfollow.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/dSofA6vuqb3CNgMh6","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"israel and the west bank","country_name":"Israel & the West Bank"},{"id":"R6l0","text":["The Gobi Gurvan Saikhan National Park, in the far south of Mongolia, features **bright orange sand** and **sand dunes**. There are two separate spots covered in the park: one in the middle just north of Sevrei, which has [distant southern mountains](https://maps.app.goo.gl/jjXtYWfWCBWUuSgs9), and the other in the far southwest corner of the park, which has a [Jeep follow car](https://maps.app.goo.gl/cHgJsPAW8xUFrK8s9)."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/mongolia/3._gobigurvansaikhan.webp","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/@43.452213,99.895723,3a,133.2y,305.6h,88.94t/data=!3m4!1e1!3m2!1ssC5fADuvY33ktVR-iMUF3g!2e0","clues":["follow_cars","scenery"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"mongolia","country_name":"Mongolia"},{"id":"yfEi","text":["A **police car**, most commonly white or black, can almost always be seen following the Street View car. The follow cars may differ slightly from the ones shown in the image."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/nigeria/JtDpCOs.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/WdpXdwj7TDDRc7GD9","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"nigeria","country_name":"Nigeria"},{"id":"pXX3","text":["A flat landscape with coastal vegetation and **many palms** can be seen east of Lekki. The ground is very **sandy**. Almost all of the coverage is old Generation 3, with a [silver follow car](https://www.google.com/maps/@6.4185992,4.079123,3a,15y,284.01h,83.67t/data=!3m6!1e1!3m4!1sTrh0nQY2S9hrUGN-v1ejng!2e0!7i13312!8i6656?entry=ttu)."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/nigeria/jj33SoO.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/1qF5JC2e47m98TbA9","clues":["follow_cars","nature","scenery"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"nigeria","country_name":"Nigeria"},{"id":"PVr3","text":["This map shows where each **old Generation 3** follow car can be found. They are uncommon, but can still be useful to know.","NOTE: The A121 is not shown on the map as it is recognizable from other clues. This [silver Lexus](https://maps.app.goo.gl/i36WGpXJW9q2fHhh7), not shown on the map, can rarely be seen on the highway between Onitsha and Enugu."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/nigeria/OWnDtAE.webp","link":"","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"nigeria","country_name":"Nigeria"},{"id":"1chu","text":["Tunisian licence plates are **black with white text**.","NOTE: Military plates feature a small Tunisian flag on the left side of the plate, which is visible on the dark green follow car."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/Tunisia_License_Plate.webp","link":"","clues":["license_plates","flags","follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"},{"id":"LVo2","text":["One of the best ways to recognize Tunisia is that, in most coverage, the Google car is escorted by a **follow car**.","There are several different follow cars and these are four of the most commonly found ones.","NOTE: Follow cars can be in front of the street view car, or very far behind. Make sure to pan and zoom if you do not find them immediately."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/followcars.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/thZSGfK31DS18U4J6","clues":["follow_cars","google_vehicles"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"},{"id":"3nZC","text":["This **light green Toyota** follow car can be found everywhere in the northernmost part of Tunisia. You will never see it south of Hammamet."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/Tunisia-north-follow-car.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/uX7XBSih82pM4H646","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"},{"id":"jiMW","text":["The **dark green Mazda** is the most common follow car in Tunisia. This becomes apparent if you look at the coverage map, it can be found all the way from Hammamet to Djerba. Aside from the darker colour, it can also be recognized by its military licence plate with a **red strip** on the left."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/Tunisia-south-follow-car.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/FxDexhTFBajv1pVo8","clues":["license_plates","follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"},{"id":"NNjW","text":["Tunis, the capital of Tunisia, has **a lot of different follow cars**. Most of them can be found all over the city. The light green Toyota can also be spotted here."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/Tunisia-Tunis-follow-cars.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/ypV2X4f88eVjsqRF6","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"},{"id":"deGy","text":["The city of Kairouan in central-northern Tunisia has this unique follow car, a **white Mitsubishi** with white mirrors. The dark green follow car can also sometimes be spotted following the Mitsubishi.","NOTE: Some white follow cars in Tunisia can look similar to the Kairouan car. However, none of them are Mitsubishis."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/Tunisia-Kairouan-follow-car.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/TYsTYQxbayDt9SU77","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"},{"id":"IOGg","text":["The island of Djerba is the only region of Tunisia where you are usually **not** accompanied by a follow car. Most coverage completely lacks one.","While it is rare, this **white Mercedes** and the dark green follow car can be present."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/Djerba_Car.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/fY8AruYDYGHQA9FM8","clues":["follow_cars"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"},{"id":"DECo","text":["The island of Djerba can sometimes have a distinct vibe. There tend to be a lot of palm trees. Whitewashed, traditional buildings with blue doors and windows are common.","NOTE: Not all locations on the island will have this distinct vibe. A lack of a follow car is another good way to confirm that you are on Djerba."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/tunisia/Tunisia-Djerba-vibe.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/niGniYJgMVZBb4U19","clues":["follow_cars","architecture","nature"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"tunisia","country_name":"Tunisia"}],"gallery_count":51,"tip_count":18}